      "message": "In `ilm.c`, we would copy part of text section from `__ilm_flash_start` to `__ilm_ram_start`, so we can run ram code for better performance.\n\nAnd in `linker.ld`, we arrange `libdrivers__serial.a`, `libkernel.a` and `libzephyr.a` within `__ilm_flash_start` ~  `__ilm_flash_end`. \n\nBelow `zephyr.map` are separately built by `CONFIG_LTO\u003dn` and `CONFIG_LTO\u003dy`\n1.`CONFIG_LTO\u003dn`:\n``````\n                0x80033000                        __ilm_flash_start \u003d .\n                0x80033000                        __sha256_pad_block_start \u003d .\n                0x80033500                        . \u003d (. + 0x500)\n *fill*         0x80033000      0x500 \n *(SORT_BY_ALIGNMENT(.__ram_code))\n .__ram_code    0x80033500       0xdc zephyr/libzephyr.a(soc.c.obj)\n                0x80033500                chip_pll_ctrl\n                0x80033522                chip_run_pll_sequence\n .__ram_code    0x800335dc      0x1aa zephyr/drivers/interrupt_controller/libdrivers__interrupt_controller.a(intc_ite_it8xxx2_v2.c.obj)\n                0x800335dc                ite_intc_irq_enable\n                0x80033626                ite_intc_irq_disable\n                0x80033674                ite_intc_irq_is_enable\n                0x800336ac                ite_intc_get_irq_num\n                0x800336b6                ite_intc_no_irq\n                0x800336c6                get_irq\n .__ram_code    0x80033786      0x3fa zephyr/drivers/flash/libdrivers__flash.a(flash_ite_it8xxx2.c.obj)\n                0x800337d0                ramcode_reset_i_cache\n                0x800337f6                ramcode_flash_follow_mode\n                0x80033818                ramcode_flash_follow_mode_exit\n                0x8003382a                ramcode_flash_fsce_high\n                0x80033846                ramcode_flash_write_dat\n                0x80033850                ramcode_flash_transaction\n                0x80033894                ramcode_flash_